---
title: "Sizing"
description: "Width, height, and their limits."
section: Utilities
sectionOrder: 3
order: 4
---

Numbers are scale steps and lengths pass through. `--w`, `--h`, `--min-w`, and `--max-w` also take the keywords `auto`, `fit-content`, `min-content`, and `max-content`, at any tier; `--size`, `--min-h`, and `--max-h` take none. For a reading column, prefer the article widths: `--max-w: var(--article-lg)`.

